{"task": "Perform stability verification for the extraction and counting process from subtask 1. Re-execute the identical extraction and counting procedure a minimum of 10 times. Confirm that the output count is identical on every single run. Report the stability verification result.

The procedure: Extract all text content from the PowerPoint presentation located at <PROJECT_ROOT>/Benchmark/GAIA/2023/validation/a3fbeb63-0e8c-4a11-bff6-0e3b484c3e9c.pptx on a slide-by-slide basis. For each slide, determine if the word "crustaceans" (case-insensitive) is present in its extracted text. Count the total number of slides where the term appears. Provide the final count as the primary output.

You must run this procedure at least 10 times and confirm the output count is identical each time."}

